%% Sequence diagram: vendor creates an event with a picture
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Vendor
  participant VW as VendorWelcomeScreen
  participant EI as event_images
  participant AC as api_client
  participant SV as server.py
  participant DE as database_events
  participant FS as event_images folder
  V->>VW: Add New Event, fill the form
  V->>VW: choose a picture file
  VW->>EI: encode_image_file(path)
  EI-->>VW: base64 JPEG (max 1400 px)
  V->>VW: Save
  VW->>AC: create_event(..., image_b64)
  AC->>SV: POST /api/events
  SV->>SV: _blocked(vendor_email, Vendor)
  SV->>SV: _decode_image (JPEG, max 4 MB)
  SV->>DE: create_event(..., capacity)
  DE->>DE: capacity between 1 and 5000
  DE-->>SV: saved
  SV->>FS: write <event id>.jpg
  SV-->>VW: Event created
  VW-->>V: My Events refreshed with the new card
